WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.020
Crypto moves fast. Tokenized real-world assets give us another

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:07.839
market to follow. Keeping up should not mean doomscrolling through

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:09.720
endless headlines and tabs.

00:00:10.961 --> 00:00:13.991
Everything brings the picture together. Use the sidebar to switch

00:00:13.991 --> 00:00:18.844
between Everything Crypto and Everything RWA, with one account across

00:00:18.844 --> 00:00:20.063
both.

00:00:21.304 --> 00:00:25.309
Crypto gives you global market value, liquidations, major coin

00:00:25.309 --> 00:00:30.128
moves, new listings and original reporting in one clear view.

00:00:31.359 --> 00:00:34.378
Open market capitalization to see the current and previous

00:00:34.378 --> 00:00:38.697
valuations behind the change. This is a change in market value, not

00:00:38.697 --> 00:00:40.368
cash flowing into crypto.

00:00:41.598 --> 00:00:45.859
Switch between one, four and twenty-four hours. Liquidations show

00:00:45.859 --> 00:00:50.062
the notional value of leveraged positions forcibly closed, with longs

00:00:50.062 --> 00:00:51.722
and shorts separated.

00:00:52.959 --> 00:00:57.707
Everything RWA brings tokenized assets and their issuers into focus.

00:00:57.707 --> 00:01:01.539
Its totals cover the mapped assets in this snapshot, not their full

00:01:01.539 --> 00:01:02.526
underlying markets.

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:08.149
Open Gold to see the tokens linked to the asset, their prices and

00:01:08.149 --> 00:01:12.166
their issuers. Issuer inventory counts are separate from your

00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:13.896
personal watchlist.

00:01:15.134 --> 00:01:18.698
Track the coins and real-world assets you care about. Separate

00:01:18.698 --> 00:01:22.576
watchlists share one account, and your preferences follow you across

00:01:22.576 --> 00:01:25.676
the website and Android app.

00:01:26.913 --> 00:01:31.023
News keeps its publisher, publication time and original story link.

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:34.854
Read the full report when you need context, and filter out the noise.

00:01:36.081 --> 00:01:40.052
Sign in to the browser extension and enable notifications. New

00:01:40.052 --> 00:01:42.803
account alerts arrive while your browser is running, even with the

00:01:42.803 --> 00:01:44.997
popup closed.

00:01:46.241 --> 00:01:50.421
Get the Android app and extension from GitHub Releases. X tracking

00:01:50.421 --> 00:01:54.229
is a paid feature coming soon. Get the picture, then get on with your

00:01:54.229 --> 00:01:56.829
day. Everything.
